From 3b8719cf1854e74df2e1a15be418faea66f7e140 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:00:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] perf(dsv41): harden SP prefill stream lifetimes, fused
 attention, and L2 prefetch defaults

Upstream base: local-inference-lab/vllm 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354
with candidate-55's series applied through 0810.

Rationale: Hardens async side-stream record_stream and exception-safe wait_stream
fencing in sp_prefill.py, optimizes DeepSeek V4.1 attention, compressor, and
model-state prefill/decode execution (gated mxfp8 async gather and shape-agnostic
15/12/12 MB L2 prefetch defaults in l2_prefetch.py, preserving explicit config
overrides).

Quality implications: None; outputs and determinism match baseline across all
cluster shapes.

Tests: pytest -q -p deepseek_models tests/models/test_deepseek_v4_1_engram.py
tests/kernels/attention/test_deepseek_v41_tilelang.py.

Upstream status: local candidate-60 patch
